903479"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877860/ss_3d4d5916025ca3abc4f645506f87cf724546b617.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767903479","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877860/ss_3d4d5916025ca3abc4f645506f87cf724546b617.600x338.jpg?t=1767903479"}],"short_description":"Naughty Geese is a 2D pixel art platformer. You control a biker goose who tries to keep his offspring safe from predators. As they like to escape and enjoy the scenery, Dad needs to go after his &quot;Naughty Geese&quot; every time. Enjoy unique gameplay that pays homage to classics of the genre.","steam_appid":2877860,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://staterastudio.com/"},"supported_languages":"English, Portuguese - Brazil","type":"game","website":"https://staterastudio.com/"}